"id":"msg_011Cg4FUsHRgPrZyAorHp1Vo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll assume you're using **Obsidian**, since \"daily note template\" and \"title/date on creation\" are common Obsidian requests. If you use a different app, tell me and I'll adjust.\n\n## Option 1: Core Templates plugin (no extra plugins)\n\nCreate a file named `Daily Template.md` in your templates folder:\n\n```markdown\n---\ntitle: {{title}}\ndate: {{date:YYYY-MM-DD}}\ntags: [daily]\n---\n\n# {{title}}\n\n**Date:** {{date:dddd, MMMM D, YYYY}}\n\n## Notes\n\n## Tasks\n- [ ]\n\n## Reflection\n```\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Settings → **Core plugins** → enable **Templates**, and set the template folder.\n2. Settings → **Daily notes** → enable it and set **Template file location** to `Daily Template`. Each new daily note now gets the template automatically.\n\n`{{title}}` is replaced with the note's filename, and `{{date:...}}` uses Moment.js format codes.\n\n## Option 2: Templater plugin (auto-applies to any new note)\n\nTemplate file (`Templates/Daily Template.md`):\n\n```markdown\n---\ntitle: <% tp.file.title %>\ndate: <% tp.date.now(\"YYYY-MM-DD\") %>\ntags: [daily]\n---\n\n# <% tp.file.title %>\n\n**Date:** <% tp.date.now(\"dddd, MMMM D, YYYY\") %>\n\n## Notes\n\n## Tasks\n- [ ]\n\n## Reflection\n```\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Install and enable **Templater**, and set the template folder to `Templates`.\n2. In Templater settings, turn on **Trigger Templater on new file creation**.\n3. Under **Folder Templates**, map the folder where your notes go (for example `Daily`) to `Templates/Daily Template.md`.\n\n**Caveat:** Templater fills in the title when the file is created, so name the note before it's created (or use the template-on-creation setting with a title prompt). If you rename the file later, the `title` and heading won't update automatically.\n\nWhich option you pick depends on whether you want this only for dated daily notes (Option 1) or for every note in a folder (Option 2)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":573,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":573},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8bc14e6e-ba41-461b-862c-a00c023af63d","uuid":"b7366ad5-bc4a-434f-a8fd-9e18d5da256c","timestamp":"2026-10-15T15:21:40.995Z","request_id":"req_011Cg4FUs4GkyqrDirk2SGwu"},{"type":"rate_limit_event","rate_limit_info":{"status":"allowed","resetsAt":1792093800,"rateLimitType":"five_hour","overageStatus":"rejected","overageDisabledReason":"out_of_credits","isUsingOverage":false,"unifiedWindows":{"five_hour":{"utilization":0.02,"resetsAt":1792093800},"seven_day":{"utilization":0.07,"resetsAt":1792501200}}},"uuid":"c3a3a3b6-fe7e-4a5e-bb33-22e524afd807","session_id":"8bc14e6e-ba41-461b-862c-a00c023af63d"},{"duration_api_ms":7638,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8bc14e6e-ba41-461b-862c-a00c023af63d","total_cost_usd":0.0008608000000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":573,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1492,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":766},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":573,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1492,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":573,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":573},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":1492,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":573,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0008608000000000001,"contextWindow":100000